'''Tecoluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] increases its range and chance to deal a [[Critical Hit]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

