==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Tecoluga was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Legend of the Nekoluga (Removed Combo)|Legend of the Nekoluga]] and [[Nekoluganomicon (Removed Combo)|Nekoluganomicon]].
*This unit's critical attack is the most damaging attack for a Metal enemy and one of the highest damages possible on all traits.
*Among the Nekoluga family, his name Te(手/te)-coluga reflects that its hands are the parts that are abnormally long.
*Lufalan Pasalan is based on [[wikia:one-piece:Monkey D. Luffy|Monkey D. Luffy]] from the manga/anime [[wikia:one-piece:One Piece (Manga)|One Piece]], which is fitting, for Tecoluga's long arms are reminiscent of Luffy's own ability to stretch like rubber.
*Tecoluga's appearance may be based on [[wikipedia:Ashinagatenaga|Tenaga]], a type of yokai with long arms.

